  "notes": "Governmental funds cash basis; business-type (combined utilities proprietary fund) accrual. Taxes 6,417,928 (p4 Total column) split using the Statement of Activities general revenues (p2): property 1,826,838 + payment in lieu 2,615 + city sales and use 4,194,703 + occupation and franchise 393,772 (adds exactly). Other financing: debt issuance 4,065,962 -> debt_proceeds; insurance recoveries 55,129 -> other_financing; transfers 4,655,099 in/out (p4). Fund balance roll-forward ties (11,107,398 -> 12,406,879). Ending cash = Balance Sheet total assets (all cash, p3); no beginning cash is printed (beginning_cash null). Business-type receipts computed from operating + nonoperating lines; disbursements = Statement of Activities combined utilities expenses 26,916,561 (p2) = operating 26,888,837 + interest 27,724; capital contributions 185,397 offset by plant cost recovered (185,397), net 0. Balance sheet: governmental lines from the Balance Sheet - Cash Basis (p3; equals the governmental activities column 12,406,879), business-type lines from the Statement of Net Position business-type column (p1), totals from the Total column (balances: 81,224,173 = 6,982,918 + 3,769,017 + 70,472,238). Detail: General, Street Department and Economic Development Fund budget schedules (pp8-10). General Fund budget schedule excludes TIF project property taxes/remittances 6,914 shown on the statement. LB840 schedule (p11) not recorded (subset of the Economic Development Fund; see decision_needed). Debt Service, Recreational Agency and Community Development Agency funds have no schedule. Read pages 1-11 of 11"
